_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122611","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122611","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122611.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122611.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-20T15:54:57Z"},"body":"Route AVAudioSession interruptions through new `OS_AppleEmbedded::audio_driver_start()` and `audio_driver_stop()` rather than `on_focus_in()/on_focus_out()`, so an audio interruption no longer toggles app focus state.\r\n\r\nAdditionally: fix audio not resuming after taking off and putting on Apple Vision Pro while an immersive Godot game is running.\r\n\r\nvisionOS Compositor Services scenes deliver `sceneDidBecomeActive:` before the audio session is ready when donning the device, so restart the audio driver after a short delay.\r\n\r\nAlso, order the scene and application lifecycle callbacks consistently, and mark the two scene callbacks that Compositor Services immersive scenes do not invoke.\r\n\r\ncc @BastiaanOlij  @stuartcarnie @bruvzg ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/R